<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen stocks closed lower in 23.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday, with the WIG 20 index down 1.7 percent to 1,661.9 points.</p>
<p>Five stocks were flat and the remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in a 13.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
